@startuml class
' Class Diagram - Colors web application
' The app has no OO classes; each file is modeled as a class with a stereotype.
title Colors application - file and table structure
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members

package "Client (browser)" {
  class "index.html" as IndexPage <<page>> {
    loginName : text input
    loginPassword : password input
    loginButton : button
    loginResult : span
  }

  class "color.html" as ColorPage <<page>> {
    userName : span
    logoutButton : button
    searchText : text input
    searchColorButton : button
    colorSearchResult : span
    colorList : p
    colorText : text input
    addColorButton : button
    colorAddResult : span
  }

  class "code.js" as CodeJS <<JavaScript>> {
    urlBase : string = "http://poosdcolorsproject.xyz/LAMPAPI" {readOnly}
    extension : string = "php" {readOnly}
    userId : number = 0
    firstName : string = ""
    lastName : string = ""
    --
    doLogin() : void
    saveCookie() : void
    readCookie() : void
    doLogout() : void
    addColor() : void
    searchColor() : void
  }

  class "md5.js" as MD5JS <<JavaScript>> {
    md5(string, key?, raw?) : string
  }
}

package "Server (LAMPAPI)" {
  class "Login.php" as LoginAPI <<PHP endpoint>> {
    getRequestInfo() : mixed
    sendResultInfoAsJson(obj) : void
    returnWithError(err) : void
    returnWithInfo(firstName, lastName, id) : void
  }

  class "AddColor.php" as AddColorAPI <<PHP endpoint>> {
    getRequestInfo() : mixed
    sendResultInfoAsJson(obj) : void
    returnWithError(err) : void
  }

  class "SearchColors.php" as SearchAPI <<PHP endpoint>> {
    getRequestInfo() : mixed
    sendResultInfoAsJson(obj) : void
    returnWithError(err) : void
    returnWithInfo(searchResults) : void
  }

  class "db.php" as DB <<PHP>> {
    config : array
    conn : mysqli
  }

  class "config.php" as Config <<PHP, gitignored>> {
    host : string
    user : string
    pass : string
    name : string
  }
}

package "Database (MySQL)" {
  class Users <<table>> {
    ID
    firstName
    lastName
    Login
    Password
  }

  class Colors <<table>> {
    UserID
    Name
  }
}

IndexPage ..> CodeJS : <<script>>
IndexPage ..> MD5JS : <<script>>\n(loaded, call commented out)
ColorPage ..> CodeJS : <<script>>

CodeJS ..> LoginAPI : POST {login, password}
CodeJS ..> AddColorAPI : POST {color, userId}
CodeJS ..> SearchAPI : POST {search, userId}

LoginAPI ..> DB : require
AddColorAPI ..> DB : require
SearchAPI ..> DB : require
DB ..> Config : require

LoginAPI ..> Users : SELECT
AddColorAPI ..> Colors : INSERT
SearchAPI ..> Colors : SELECT ... LIKE

Users "1" -- "0..*" Colors : logical link: ID = UserID

legend bottom
  Structural model: file boxes use class notation; the app defines no OO classes.
  Members represent file-scope variables/functions or HTML elements, not instances.
  md5() is shown as the public API; internal helpers are omitted. ? marks optional arguments.
  getRequestInfo() uses json_decode(..., true); a valid request object yields an array.
  config.php is required and gitignored; the listed keys are expected by db.php.
  Table columns are those referenced by PHP, not a complete database schema.
  Search uses UserID; INSERT uses UserId (same column; MySQL column names are case-insensitive).
  1 to 0..* reflects app behavior: each color row stores one user's ID, a user can add many.
  SQL types, keys, and foreign-key enforcement are unverified because no SQL schema is included.
end legend
@enduml
